  "published": "2026-09-30T12:39:30.333Z",
  "releaseNotes": "## [9.0.0]\n### Changed\n- **Penneo.SDK is deprecated** and will not receive further updates. The public API is marked obsolete so consuming projects get a compiler warning.\n- Updated RestSharp from `112.0.0` to `114.0.0`. RestSharp 114 changed `IAuthenticator.Authenticate` to take a `CancellationToken`, which threw `TypeLoadException` against 8.0.1.\n- Updated Newtonsoft.Json from `13.0.3` to `13.0.4`.\n- Replaced the dedicated `net6.0` target with `net8.0`. `netstandard2.0` and `net48` are unchanged. .NET 8 and newer use the `net8.0` asset; older .NET apps use the `netstandard2.0` asset.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
  "title": "Penneo .Net SDK",
  "verbatimVersion": "9.0.0",
